<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi courts have sentenced seven French citizens to lengthy prison terms for Islamic State membership, including six life sentences, while security forces have repeatedly intercepted unidentified drones over Baghdad, with at least one downed by air defenses. Yazidi militia units linked to the PKK are disarming and joining the Iraqi army, and other militia groups have pledged to disarm by mid-2027. Baghdad is engaged in ongoing talks with the Gulf states and Iran on a regional security plan, and the Iraqi prime minister is meeting Jordanian officials to boost trade and energy cooperation. The conflict produced 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxOeDJKUHdzbXB2am5BNmlYYnJsWlo3YjZSSGJBTlN5NVRNQkVJR2c5YUpIclBrYW9kaDkwcHZGYVcyS0N4X0I0UWtZblVndmRIaEVXSjNEYUw4ZE1Mc2pmVzIycWFwY2dCbnJLRWNwejFtMHNzQWpjYm9qZVZ3a2Zhdk1MLTI4cE42Q2ViQXdLV1RYV29GMlEyMnMyX0dfSEh3azVsMGdsV0VaT3l1Rm9wNXFOb3lBdElzME96a0h4d3IzTEF3ZXEw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNd3diR0NyX0hNdXhLdktmb3J1bXZwYjBHd3k3XzlRQ1dBU29nd1BxYlh2aWREUGVBNjdiN011Q3RvM0UtRjVjVDAzbDVLZFNWSmprcVAzc3FKaWxXY05laEhQQllPTUNpYk1OQXRkWS1mb2xOOUY0Q3NSZUxFazdlSV9EOFNyclNWSUl1UTVSUjMzZFlvTzJWdnFOa1ItTkhZNjd6V3hfOENISXFuZWhRT3JlVlEzQkNjbnlreWRXZUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9OeTc1VE5lcEx0QzNhVlh6TnBVZUhfdi1MR0xZQnJOLWo2U3dHb09ucVhPNXctSTFXNTF6R3EwZEJXSl96SF9zS2FPUWFwcHpHeFVMaGtUckZiaGIydHc1SFMwT3U1R1h5WnMtY2RGUkdtYm1jV2VUMWFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNUzJDUXRkNklTTk5